{
	"name": "Powder Burn",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/guns/gun-blunderbuss-gold.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>While within close proximity, you angle your weapon to allow the powder to sear your target. When making an attack against a target within 10ft, you deal an additional 2 points of fire damage and force your target to make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, your target catches on fire and takes 1d4 damage at the end of each of their turns until they take an action to put the fire out. Swimming or otherwise being immersed in water also ends the effect. The burning lasts a number of rounds equal to your Dexterity modifier.</p>",
